{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24117","headline":"偶以拙诗数首寄呈裴少尹侍郎蒙以盛制四篇一时酬和重投长句美而谢之 · 白居易","name":"偶以拙诗数首寄呈裴少尹侍郎蒙以盛制四篇一时酬和重投长句美而谢之","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"投君之文甚荒芜，数篇价直一束刍。\n报我之章何璀璨，累累四贯骊龙珠。\n毛诗三百篇後得，文选六十卷中无。\n一麋丽龟绝报赛，五鹿连柱难支梧。\n高兴独因秋日尽，清吟多与好风俱。\n银钩金错两殊重，宜上屏风张座隅。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24117.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24117","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}